X:1
T:Nocturne Op. 55 No. 1
C:Frédéric Chopin
O:Nocturne in F minor, Op. 55 No. 1
N:The opening theme and its repeat (16 bars); the middle section is left out.
N:Transposed down a fourth from F minor to C minor, so the notes run from C4 to
N:C5. Notes from two Humdrum first-edition encodings (ifdo.ca, kern2abc) that
N:agree. Left out: the trills in bars 6 and 14 and the grace notes
N:in bars 4, 6, 8, 12, 14, 15 and 16.
N:The last bar stops after three beats, where the next pass's pickup G, tied to
N:the first note, comes in. Chords simplified from the left hand.
M:4/4
Q:1/4=66
L:1/8
